  unitName: Hades Glare Sirius
  unitId: 50915
  unitNumber: 1275
  description: History has proven that Sirius was without fault. He was respected
    by many, but it's uncertain whether his father saw him as a promising successor
    or a future adversary. The emperor of Bariura was known to be particularly unforgiving
    to his own kin, and the fact that he kept Sirius close to the very end would
    suggest that he saw his true potential. However, some scholars argue that the
    emperor was in fact taking advantage of Sirius, using his popularity to cover
    something up.
  summonDesc: Father trusted everyone in the imperial family, no...all of humanity.
    But he did not have faith in them to do good...
  fusionDesc: It's easy to choose the simple path.<br>But won't you come with me
    to find the rewards of challenge?
  evoDesc: My name is Sirius,<br>first imperial prince of Bariura,<br>and true successor
    to the throne!
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
